==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Phantump|14}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*'''Spooky Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Misdreavus|57}} and {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Mismagius|58}} from the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

